Cross-references resolve inside footnote bodies

```
# H

Body[^n]

[^n]: see </#h>
.
<section id="H">
  <h1>H</h1>
  <p>Body<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
</section>
<section role="doc-endnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>see <a href="#H">H</a><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```
